Use `repeat(auto-fit, minmax(...))` for an automatic, responsive grid without media queries.

```css
.container {
  display: grid;
  gap: 1rem;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
}

.item {
  background: #f0f0f0;
  padding: 1rem;
}
