**How it works:**
1.  **`repeat(auto-fit, ...)`**: Automatically fits as many columns as possible.
2.  **`minmax(250px, 1fr)`**: Each item is at least 250px wide, then takes up free space (`1fr`).
3.  **Responsiveness**: On large screens, items sit side-by-side. As the viewport shrinks below 750px (depending on content), items drop to the next row automatically. When space is tight enough, the grid collapses to a single column.

